Third party attribution

The device class names and their canonical units in
vocabulary/device-classes.json are adopted from Home Assistant
(https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/sensor/#device-class),
Copyright Home Assistant contributors, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. They are used so that data produced against this registry stays
interoperable with the wider ecosystem.

Component specifications in this registry are factual values drawn from
manufacturer datasheets, cited per entry in the datasheet_url field. Driver
entries reference third party libraries by name in order to install them. They
do not reproduce those libraries, and each remains under its own licence.
